  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "=\n\nDuplication text bug:  There is a bug that displays the text twice. Numbers 1-5 on this list, are places where the duplicate text bug is found.\n\n1.) Main Menu > Settings > Audio & Voice > Hover over \"Reset\", and \"Change Device\".\n\n2.) Main Menu > Settings > Mirrors > Hover over \"Reset\".\n\n3.) Main Menu > Settings > User Interface > Hover over \"Change Language\", \"Clear Chatbox\", and \"Show Keyboard\".\n\n4.) Main Menu > Settings > Debug > Hover over \"Report Bug\", \"Clear Local Profile Data\", \"Open Logs Folder\", \"Clear Content Cache\" \"Clear Local Avatar Data\".\n\n5.) Main Menu > Settings > Accessibility > Hover over \"Clear Chatbox\" and \"Show Keyboard\".\n\n=\n\nNew inconsistencies found: Numbered 6-7 on this list.\n\n6.) Quick Menu > Panic/Safe Mode button. There is no tooltip for the enable button, or disable button. On Live version, it says \"Enable Safe Mode\" and \"Disable Safe Mode\" respectively.\n\n7.) Main Menu > Settings > User Interface > Background Designs > There is a period and a space lacking between \"following option: X\" and the new sentence, \"Click to view photo details\". On Live version, it only says \"Click to view photo details.\"; I assume that the latter sentence needs to be erased.\n\n=\n\nErrors on both Live version, and beta: Numbered 8-9 on this list.\n\n8.) Quick Menu > Wing > Group. There is an duplication error that displays \"View your online friends\", which is the same as hovering over the 'Friends' tab. This error IS on live, but I figured I'd throw it in here.\n\n9.) Main Menu > Settings > Graphics > Bloom Intensity > I feel like the tooltip should say \"Set to 0%\" instead of \"Set to 0\". This is also on Live, but I'm putting it here anyhow.",
